# Context rules for .oss-scanner/Dockerfile only (BuildKit prefers <Dockerfile>.dockerignore over the root file).
# Unlike the root .dockerignore it keeps docs/ in the image, so the scanner can read the design record at /src/docs.
# The scanner adds .git back itself after the build.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/.DS_Store
.claude/worktrees
CLAUDE.local.md
scratchpad
